WEBVTT

00:22.290 --> 00:26.250
I have to find a warmer place.

00:31.970 --> 00:33.300
It'll be all right.

00:33.930 --> 00:36.720
I'll save you, Akashi-kun.

00:38.430 --> 00:39.890
Sasame...

00:41.560 --> 00:43.430
All for the sake of protecting you...

00:44.140 --> 00:46.190
To achieve that, I...

00:49.610 --> 00:51.820
...became one with Minashi.

00:53.530 --> 00:54.700
Stop it.

00:55.490 --> 00:57.910
It's all for you.

01:02.790 --> 01:03.960
Stop it!

01:08.250 --> 01:11.250
I can understand Sasame's heart.

01:11.250 --> 01:13.720
Get away from her!

01:14.380 --> 01:18.300
We will finally become one so that we can protect you.

01:19.180 --> 01:21.680
S-Stop it.

01:21.680 --> 01:22.930
Please, stop...

01:56.720 --> 02:05.060
The ink on today's graffiti runs

02:05.060 --> 02:16.070
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

02:16.070 --> 02:27.040
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

02:27.040 --> 02:31.420
Where is our proof?

02:31.420 --> 02:36.510
It's mankinds nature to come together

02:36.510 --> 02:41.550
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

02:41.550 --> 02:46.350
My sins are to be doubted

02:46.350 --> 02:52.690
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

02:56.070 --> 03:01.530
We really are

03:10.040 --> 03:12.250
The Dark Metal

03:27.220 --> 03:30.640
Episode 15
Vacant Heart of Morning Gray

03:46.710 --> 03:49.560
This tree is called Arbornine.

03:49.560 --> 03:52.290
It cleanses the toxins from your body.

03:53.730 --> 03:58.000
And Arbornine will protect you from
the calamities of the Lightless Realm.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.710
Sa—

04:00.240 --> 04:02.660
You still haven't fully rested.

04:12.810 --> 04:15.660
You lost your voice, didn't you?

04:18.300 --> 04:20.390
She looks just like Sasame.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.530
Who is she?

04:22.350 --> 04:23.340
I see.

04:23.340 --> 04:28.350
Your emotional wounds are far more greater than your physical wounds.

04:29.980 --> 04:31.370
Sasame...

04:31.810 --> 04:33.150
Akashi-kun.

04:34.260 --> 04:36.750
I'll protect you, Akashi-kun.

04:37.420 --> 04:40.000
It was her wish and her wish alone.

04:40.780 --> 04:45.380
To become a LIM so that she could protect everyone.

04:45.380 --> 04:46.970
S-Sasa...

04:55.130 --> 04:56.060
A blunder?

04:57.270 --> 05:01.800
So you don't like being left behind either, Akashi?

05:02.700 --> 05:05.070
She knows my name?

05:05.070 --> 05:07.010
Wait here for a minute.

05:13.380 --> 05:16.410
If you keep this on, it will be able to...

05:18.220 --> 05:22.630
That's right. This wench was with the Corpse.

05:27.410 --> 05:29.100
Just what in the world is she?

05:32.130 --> 05:36.520
She's speaking directly into my mind.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.300
But...

05:38.980 --> 05:42.110
It seems she's unable to hear my voice.

05:42.110 --> 05:43.430
Right.

05:43.430 --> 05:45.100
I can't hear your voice.

05:47.150 --> 05:49.190
Did I guess what you were thinking correctly?

05:55.290 --> 05:59.500
I can feel that you're thinking about something.

05:59.500 --> 06:03.950
However, I can't quite tell exactly what.

06:17.500 --> 06:19.940
Your heart is cowering.

06:21.210 --> 06:24.550
It fears something and has completely shut itself.

06:24.550 --> 06:26.900
That's why I can't hear anything.

06:26.900 --> 06:32.810
If you can let me into your heart,
your voice should return.

06:34.200 --> 06:36.520
My heart is cowering?

06:46.050 --> 06:47.590
This way.

06:50.680 --> 06:54.470
They do look similar.

07:08.890 --> 07:11.110
I wonder if Akashi's all right.

07:11.110 --> 07:15.330
Akashi's always had the devil's luck, so he'll be fine.

07:15.330 --> 07:16.810
I believe in him.

07:17.690 --> 07:19.230
Believe, huh?

07:19.230 --> 07:20.940
Words are so trivial.

07:22.360 --> 07:26.340
You know how at times we can hear each others thoughts?

07:27.450 --> 07:29.580
That kind of thing comforts me.

07:30.830 --> 07:33.490
On the other hand, sometimes hearing them scares me.

07:33.490 --> 07:38.550
Even when you say it's all right, I can sense that it's not what you're actually thinking.

07:40.620 --> 07:43.420
What good would it do me to lie to you?

07:43.420 --> 07:47.220
Besides, I don't think it's really
a good thing to always be connected.

07:50.470 --> 07:51.570
Do you really think so?

07:52.560 --> 07:53.730
Yes, I do.

07:59.190 --> 08:03.870
If our thoughts were always linked, you'd totally know how I feel.

08:06.880 --> 08:09.110
So, Isaku Heito...

08:09.110 --> 08:13.370
Roughly 40% of his body turned into Necrometal.

08:13.370 --> 08:15.330
40%...

08:15.330 --> 08:18.760
I'm sure it's not my place to say this, but isn't that a bit low?

08:18.760 --> 08:24.020
It is, considering the time he spent right in the center of the Lightless Realm.

08:24.020 --> 08:27.980
It's probably because he retained resonance with Emiru,

08:28.460 --> 08:32.800
not to mention that Heito himself had a powerful ego,
which most likely acted as a barrier.

08:32.800 --> 08:34.730
So there was no light?

08:35.770 --> 08:36.810
Were you scared?

08:38.410 --> 08:40.690
Were you linked to Emiru?

08:57.240 --> 08:59.580
As for Akashi...

08:59.580 --> 09:03.880
If his heart was unstable because of how he felt about Sasame, then...

09:04.670 --> 09:06.420
Even so, what can we do?

09:08.090 --> 09:11.110
If there's anything we can do right now, tell me.

09:11.850 --> 09:13.060
I don't know.

09:13.680 --> 09:16.200
Maybe I should have stopped him back then.

09:17.660 --> 09:19.630
Can you take care of this for me?

09:19.630 --> 09:20.410
Sure.

09:21.730 --> 09:23.390
Wh-Wha—Susan?

09:24.270 --> 09:25.860
What was that for?

09:25.860 --> 09:29.090
Don't bring your negative feelings into an ongoing operation!

09:29.090 --> 09:30.030
It's an annoyance!

09:30.650 --> 09:31.630
Sorry...

09:31.630 --> 09:34.370
You? Trying to stop them? For who?!

09:35.340 --> 09:37.660
For Akashi and Sasame...

09:37.660 --> 09:41.000
They thought it out, agonized, and made up their minds!

09:41.000 --> 09:43.810
There's no way someone like you could stop them!

09:44.580 --> 09:46.600
It was the same with Aoshi-kun, wasn't it?

09:49.010 --> 09:51.090
You're right.

09:51.090 --> 09:55.060
When Akashi said he was going into the Lightless Realm by himself...

09:56.640 --> 10:00.310
At that moment, I thought
he had the same eyes Aoshi did.

10:01.700 --> 10:04.410
The eyes that said I couldn't stop him.

10:06.230 --> 10:09.530
Listen, the enemy that we're
fighting is that over there, got it?

10:11.490 --> 10:15.580
Even if we regret the past, that thing isn't going to go away.

10:16.240 --> 10:19.330
It doesn't care about our
circumstances and chases us regardless.

10:20.540 --> 10:21.680
Yeah.

10:26.250 --> 10:30.170
Have you noticed those few places
that haven't turned into Nectrometal?

10:30.170 --> 10:32.680
That's because Arbornine grows in each of those locations.

10:34.690 --> 10:39.110
If you're near an Arbornine,
you have nothing to worry about.

10:49.570 --> 10:51.150
It's all right.

10:51.150 --> 10:54.490
This bracelet is made from Arbornine too.

10:55.400 --> 10:57.010
It'll protect you, Akashi.

10:57.740 --> 10:59.260
It'll protect you, Akashi-kun.

11:01.450 --> 11:04.910
I wanted to protect Sasame.

11:04.910 --> 11:07.980
But you were the one who was protected.

11:07.980 --> 11:11.380
I'll defeat the Corpse,

11:12.550 --> 11:13.980
so can you wait for me?

11:13.980 --> 11:16.510
Had she waited for your return,

11:16.510 --> 11:19.990
she would've died without being able
to become a LIM, leaving nothing but her regrets.

11:19.990 --> 11:24.370
We will finally become one, so that we can protect you.

11:26.080 --> 11:30.060
Everything is for your sake, Akashi.

11:31.760 --> 11:34.880
I never asked for this.

11:34.880 --> 11:36.120
Akashi?

11:38.750 --> 11:41.290
I was the one who wanted to protect you.

11:42.090 --> 11:44.410
I wanted to save you.

11:46.310 --> 11:47.810
Akashi, what are you—

11:48.160 --> 11:49.560
Stop it already!

11:49.560 --> 11:50.960
Don't!

11:55.200 --> 11:55.840
Don't do that!

12:05.310 --> 12:06.370
Idiot!

12:24.970 --> 12:25.750
Stop it!

12:29.040 --> 12:30.450
Don't hurt Akashi!

12:33.170 --> 12:37.170
This wench—no, this girl.

12:37.170 --> 12:40.090
I won't hurt you.

12:40.090 --> 12:41.890
I'm not your enemy.

12:41.890 --> 12:44.150
She isn't my enemy.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.870
You are...

12:47.540 --> 12:48.480
I'm...

12:48.480 --> 12:51.330
I'm always the one who's protected.

12:51.810 --> 12:52.980
It's all right.

12:52.980 --> 12:55.290
I will protect you.

12:56.280 --> 12:59.660
Once again, I'm the one being protected.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.010
I am...

13:22.940 --> 13:25.530
I've had enough...

13:28.240 --> 13:32.830
I've had enough of being protected!

13:44.240 --> 13:46.080
I can finally hear you.

13:47.710 --> 13:49.010
I can finally speak...

13:49.580 --> 13:50.540
Yup.

13:50.540 --> 13:53.010
You opened up your heart to me.

13:53.580 --> 13:54.670
My heart?

13:56.130 --> 13:57.440
There's so much blood!

14:12.140 --> 14:14.160
Sasame...

14:20.230 --> 14:21.500
You're...

14:23.400 --> 14:23.940
Akashi!

14:27.200 --> 14:29.220
I'm in a bind...

14:29.220 --> 14:35.180
If Akashi-kun turned into Necrometal,
I'm going to be full of LIMs with no pilots.

14:36.380 --> 14:39.760
It would be easy for me to say
I'm looking for new pilots, but...

14:41.630 --> 14:46.150
It hurts that I've lost so many
experimental samples thanks to all those idiots.

14:47.090 --> 14:50.360
We really should have left them alive.

14:50.970 --> 14:51.980
Seriously!

14:57.480 --> 14:59.480
You'll be fine here.

15:00.520 --> 15:05.530
There's Arbornine growing here, so this place has resisted the Necrometal's advance.

15:07.480 --> 15:09.060
Hey, come here.

15:11.700 --> 15:13.970
Let's ride this together. Please?

15:15.470 --> 15:16.790
Sasame...

15:17.720 --> 15:18.390
Yeah.

15:30.800 --> 15:32.110
Does it hurt here?

15:33.520 --> 15:35.080
Such a vibrant red.

15:35.080 --> 15:38.220
A wound you suffered in order to protect me.

15:38.790 --> 15:41.940
I protected Sasame?

15:41.940 --> 15:44.740
You were the one who protected me.

15:47.350 --> 15:48.950
I see...

15:49.520 --> 15:51.220
I was able to protect her.

15:51.740 --> 15:53.710
I was able to protect Sasame.

15:57.660 --> 15:58.680
Akashi?

15:58.680 --> 16:01.800
It feels like something like this happened in the past.

16:03.900 --> 16:07.820
Everyone that was inside the Lightless Realm got rained on.

16:10.760 --> 16:11.880
Back then,

16:11.880 --> 16:13.540
You'll catch a cold.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.560
you were drenched by the rain.

16:13.890 --> 16:15.140
Thank you.

16:17.270 --> 16:19.310
And that's when I lent you my jacket.

16:26.990 --> 16:28.000
Sasame?

16:28.000 --> 16:29.920
I don't want a jacket.

16:29.920 --> 16:31.050
Hold on!

16:34.240 --> 16:35.340
Sasame!

16:59.950 --> 17:00.830
Sorry.

17:00.830 --> 17:02.400
Call out my name.

17:06.110 --> 17:07.080
Sasame?

17:07.570 --> 17:09.550
Say my name.

17:12.800 --> 17:13.970
Sasame.

17:24.780 --> 17:26.920
Let's take shelter from the rain.

17:35.100 --> 17:36.280
It's so cold.

17:36.280 --> 17:37.390
Over here.

18:27.940 --> 18:29.460
This is...

18:33.030 --> 18:34.030
The Corpse.

18:38.130 --> 18:41.080
This is the Corpse?

18:41.080 --> 18:42.370
It's not dead.

18:42.370 --> 18:44.410
It's just resting for a bit.

18:44.410 --> 18:46.090
It seems like it's a bit tired, though.

18:47.100 --> 18:48.100
But...

18:48.540 --> 18:50.670
It said it hurt very much.

18:52.420 --> 18:55.030
Hey, can you apologize?

18:55.470 --> 18:56.990
Apologize?

18:56.990 --> 18:59.680
Yes. It's trembling, right?

18:59.680 --> 19:01.680
It's frightened of you.

19:01.680 --> 19:02.890
The poor thing.

19:02.890 --> 19:05.140
Why should I apologize?

19:05.140 --> 19:07.200
Because it's your fault.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.960
My fault?

19:08.960 --> 19:10.460
But because of that thing...

19:10.900 --> 19:13.490
Because of that thing, you became a LIM!

19:15.030 --> 19:16.130
Became a LIM...

19:16.570 --> 19:17.630
That's not true, right?

19:19.130 --> 19:20.790
Yeah, it's not true...

19:21.460 --> 19:24.830
Because you haven't turned into a LIM at all.

19:24.830 --> 19:26.580
You're right here.

19:26.580 --> 19:27.710
That's right.

19:27.710 --> 19:29.710
I'm right here.

19:29.710 --> 19:31.690
I'll always be here.

19:32.130 --> 19:33.520
Always?

19:33.960 --> 19:35.720
That's right.

19:35.720 --> 19:37.800
You'll be with me from now on, Akashi.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.700
We'll be together forever.

19:42.620 --> 19:43.810
Akashi-kun.

19:45.100 --> 19:45.870
Akashi...

19:49.100 --> 19:50.730
Really?

19:50.730 --> 19:54.340
You're really going to be together with me?

19:55.110 --> 19:55.940
Yup.

19:55.940 --> 19:57.110
Always...

19:57.110 --> 20:00.090
I'll always be together with you, Akashi.

20:00.520 --> 20:01.950
I see...

20:01.950 --> 20:04.470
That means I can stop searching for you.

20:05.040 --> 20:06.290
Back then...

20:06.290 --> 20:09.880
Hey, where are you?

20:07.620 --> 20:09.590
I was searching hard too.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.460
Where?

20:12.460 --> 20:14.210
Where did everyone go?

20:18.010 --> 20:19.190
Akashi-kun.

20:26.770 --> 20:30.230
I've been searching for you all this time.

20:32.860 --> 20:37.210
I'll shut those lips of yours that keep calling an evil name.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.470
Akashi.

20:45.910 --> 20:46.640
Akashi...

20:56.840 --> 20:58.820
You're not her...

21:06.220 --> 21:07.560
You're...

21:14.480 --> 21:16.460
...Tsugumi.

21:17.650 --> 21:20.090
You finally remembered me.

21:21.360 --> 21:24.910
My name is...

21:31.670 --> 21:32.810
This is...

21:58.020 --> 22:00.790
What have I been doing?

22:01.650 --> 22:04.740
I'm sure I was protecting Sasame...

22:04.740 --> 22:06.370
And I said we'd always be together.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.690
No, that's not it.

22:09.520 --> 22:12.920
Sasame is inside that thing!

22:18.670 --> 22:21.400
So you saved Akashi.

22:21.400 --> 22:22.900
U-Um...

22:23.720 --> 22:26.400
It's been a while, Tsugumi.

22:32.900 --> 22:34.050
Minashi...

22:56.390 --> 23:00.440
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.440 --> 23:05.190
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.190 --> 23:10.070
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.070 --> 23:12.660
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.660 --> 23:15.950
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:15.950 --> 23:18.540
Blinded by reality

23:18.540 --> 23:20.710
Broken ideology

23:20.710 --> 23:23.250
Heart in captivity

23:23.250 --> 23:25.590
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.590 --> 23:28.090
Seize your capability

23:28.090 --> 23:30.470
Endless possibility

23:30.470 --> 23:32.800
Find your individuality

23:32.890 --> 23:35.010
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:35.010 --> 23:37.680
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.680 --> 23:39.480
I know now to find the way

23:39.480 --> 23:42.480
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.480 --> 23:44.020
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:44.020 --> 23:47.280
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.280 --> 23:49.490
Facing a new day

23:49.490 --> 23:51.480
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.480 --> 23:54.490
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.490 --> 23:56.830
My way or no way

23:56.830 --> 23:59.290
Today you’re falling away

23:59.290 --> 24:01.620
My way or no way

24:01.620 --> 24:04.920
Today I’m breaking away

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Episode 16

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Promised Together
